      "instance_name": "man",
      "label": "man in professional attire",
      "description": "A Black man wearing a light gray button-up shirt and tie, sitting at a desk with a laptop. He has a thoughtful expression, with his hand near his mouth, suggesting contemplation or hesitation. He is positioned in an office setting with large windows in the background. His posture and expression align with the text 'i don't always speak my mind,' indicating internal conflict or self-doubt about speaking up.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
