      "label": "man_contemplating_speaking_up",
      "description": "A scene depicting a man in professional attire sitting at a desk with a laptop, appearing thoughtful and hesitant. His posture and expression suggest internal conflict or self-doubt about speaking his mind, as indicated by the text overlay 'i don't always speak my mind.' The setting is an office with large windows in the background, reinforcing the professional context.",
