      "instance_name": "professional_setting",
      "label": "Professional setting",
      "description": "An environment where individuals are expected to behave in a formal, respectful, and often reserved manner. The office setting with the laptop and formal attire reinforces the context of workplace dynamics where speaking one’s mind can be risky or socially awkward.",
